<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Animals" id="0012728d" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsWhite" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Muchas personas creen que los animales son criaturas con pelo como los gatos, los perros, los conejos o los caballos. Pero el reino animal también incluye insectos, peces, lagartos y muchas otras criaturas. En el mundo viven millones de clases de animales.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Animales &lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0012728d_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="54" y="1"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Orangután&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>178</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>174</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>371</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Orangután&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="50" y="2" w="80" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="259" y="107"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Escarabajo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>185</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>186</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>185</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Escarabajo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="255" y="108" w="83" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="264" y="235"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Flamenco&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>184</x><y>127</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>128</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>249</y></point><point><x>186</x><y>246</y></point><point><x>184</x><y>127</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Flamenco&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="260" y="236" w="75" h="17"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="282" y="360"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pez&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>188</x><y>258</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>256</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>188</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>188</x><y>258</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pez&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="278" y="361" w="34" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B82A531, 25A40886, 25A411E2, 25A41215</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Animales&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="2"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los animales viven en casi todos los lugares de la Tierra. Los camellos pueden sobrevivir días o incluso semanas en el tórrido desierto sin tomar apenas agua o alimentos. Los pingüinos viven en la Antártida, donde la temperatura es extremadamente fría. Algunos animales, como las cabras de las nieves, viven en lugares muy elevados. Otros, como el rape de las profundidades, viven en el fondo de los océanos, donde reina la más completa oscuridad.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;¿Dónde viven los animales?&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0012728d_2.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="76" y="1"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Camellos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>219</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>218</x><y>184</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Camellos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="72" y="2" w="70" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="290" y="1"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pingüinos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>231</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>182</y></point><point><x>229</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>231</x><y>4</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pingüinos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="286" y="2" w="74" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="29" y="190"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Cabra de las nieves&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>189</x><y>193</y></point><point><x>186</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>371</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>194</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Cabra de las nieves&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="25" y="191" w="139" h="17"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="216" y="189"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Rape de las profundidades&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>197</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>195</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>200</x><y>372</y></point><point><x>197</x><y>194</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Rape de las profundidades&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="212" y="190" w="187" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B82355C, 29D29336, 25A45C79, 1B8239F7</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;¿Dónde viven los animales?&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los animales tienen tamaños muy diferentes. El animal terrestre más grande es el elefante africano. El animal terrestre más alto es la jirafa. Pero el animal más grande que ha habido nunca en nuestro planeta es la ballena azul. Una ballena azul adulta puede ser más grande que dos autobuses escolares y sólo su corazón alcanza el tamaño de un coche pequeño. &lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Gigantes de la tierra y del mar&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0012728d.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="11" y="172"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Jirafa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>7</x><y>172</y></point><point><x>66</x><y>169</y></point><point><x>65</x><y>125</y></point><point><x>77</x><y>81</y></point><point><x>45</x><y>73</y></point><point><x>13</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>7</x><y>172</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Jirafa&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="7" y="173" w="49" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="153" y="110"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Elefante africano&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>70</x><y>171</y></point><point><x>153</x><y>172</y></point><point><x>162</x><y>117</y></point><point><x>145</x><y>90</y></point><point><x>92</x><y>100</y></point><point><x>77</x><y>116</y></point><point><x>70</x><y>171</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Elefante africano&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="149" y="111" w="125" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="177" y="288"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ballena azul&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>6</x><y>215</y></point><point><x>41</x><y>204</y></point><point><x>82</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>157</x><y>180</y></point><point><x>209</x><y>180</y></point><point><x>325</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>232</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>260</y></point><point><x>295</x><y>293</y></point><point><x>142</x><y>273</y></point><point><x>22</x><y>290</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>215</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ballena azul&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="173" y="289" w="91" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Gigantes de la tierra y del mar&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Hay animales que están en peligro de desaparecer en todo el mundo. Esto se debe, fundamentalmente, a la caza excesiva y a la destrucción de los lugares donde viven. Muchas personas están trabajando para proteger a los animales amenazados.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Animales amenazados&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0012728d_5.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="21" y="170"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Panda gigante&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>5</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>134</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>133</x><y>181</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Panda gigante&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="17" y="171" w="104" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="227" y="170"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcol